# The woodcutter walks on screen between two shots: after the first shot the game ticks frame by frame, and each frame
# that ticks draws him at his new place, painted between the objects in row order.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh woodcutter-walks-on --layout layouts/woodcutter.jsonc --fps 10
wait 0.3
fast-forward woodcutter state 0x10 max 20000
scroll up 6 1056 520
wait 0.3
shot before 14 11 2 4
wait 1.5
shot after 14 11 2 4
